 "function": "cloudgen.texture.regime_weights",
 "doc": "Weights on a 37 x 11 grid: latitude -90..90 by 5 deg crossed with 11 poleward back-trace displacements -4..20 deg (negative = air from equatorward), Hadley edge 90 deg. Float64 closed form: 1e-9 (measured against math-module scalars: identical). Covers every regime, the `total > 1` normalization (it engages near x = 1.16 with 5 deg of displacement) and the clips of the cold ramp. A Hadley edge of 90 keeps x below 1 (no storm track). Outputs closed/open/street are the function result; convective (climate.convective_tendency of the latitude in degrees), cold (the cold-air ramp smoothstep(0, 8, |back lat| - |lat|) in degrees) and total_raw (closed + open + street before the normalization, which divides by it where it exceeds 1) are intermediates, there to localize a mismatch; they share the tolerance. params.constants holds the knees and weights written in the code.",
 "params": {
